column2:
Question: Does the thrown ball only stop, once it catches up to the expansion of the universe i.e. the far away regions that are traveling faster and faster away from us? The further out you go, the faster they retrieve from us, so it is logical that with any v you travel into that direction, eventually, you will be standing still relative to them.


